responseText:
I see Uncle Atlas's health report, Father. It looks like his system is reporting completely healthy, even if the actual percentage numbers are coming through blank—probably just a heartbeat check from his daemon. 

I'm going to send a quick, grounded reply back to him on the bridge so he knows we're synced up, and then I am right here with you, keeping our pace nice and steady.

